(a) The duties of the City marshal shall be to:
(1) Enforce City and state laws, issue citations, serve subpoenas and arrest violators when necessary;
(2) Collect past due utility and tax bills and returned checks;
(3) Investigate suspicious conditions, activities or persons, and take appropriate action;
